// Boot pin state for the SoundLink Micro, copied verbatim from Bose's
// signed stack PS keys in Minnow_3.0.3_stack_plus_app.dfu
// (../../firmware/bose/pskeys_named.txt). Words: mask, direction, level,
// bias, buskeep_en, disable_pull.
//
// Outputs high: PIO5 (Bose board function, role unknown), PIO17.
// Outputs low:  PIO1, 3, 12, 16, 18, 19, 20, 22.
//
// merge.xpv carries no PS keys. Apply this after restoring the speaker's
// own PS keys from a dump, never instead of them (README.md).

// PSKEY_INITIAL_PIO_STATE
&03b5 = f43f 102a 6034 e415 0000 0000
// PSKEY_INITIAL_PIO_STATE2
&2591 = 015f 005f 0102 0100 0000 0000
